 whole path to a .xrns file that isn't there yet; the song is that file from then on). A song never saved is saved only under path, and never over a file. (version is REAPER's: Renoise refuses it.)","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"pid":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"The Renoise process to use, from discover, when several run."},"resource":{"type":"string","description":"The Renoise resource or preferences folder to use, from discover, when several run."},"version":{"type":"boolean"},"path":{"type":"string"},"epoch":{"type":"string","description":"The epoch of the answer the project was read in: if the project open now is another, the save is refused as stale."}},"required":["epoch"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"render","title":"Render in Renoise","description":"Renders a stretch of the Renoise project offline (silently, faster than real time) to WAV files in Kumi's folder, as a job: {jobId, state, seconds, files}. Follow it with listen_job, stop it with listen_cancel. Every setting Renoise changes for it is put back.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"pid":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"The Renoise process to use, from discover, when several run."},"resource":{"type":"string","description":"The Renoise resource or preferences folder to use, from discover, when several run."},"sources":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":18,"description":"What to render, each to its own file.","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,32}$","description":"Your name for the file."},"what":{"enum":["master","track"],"description":"The mix as it leaves the master track, or one track on its own."},"ref":{"type":"string","description":"For a track: its ref."},"stage":{"enum":["pre-fader","post-fader","items"],"description":"For a track: before or after its fader (pre-fade